---
title: "initialize (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: receive config params
    q_validate --> q_set_refund: validate refundPeriodSeconds <= 2 weeks
    q_validate --> q_revert_invalid: invalid config
    q_revert_invalid --> [*]: revert InvalidConfiguration
    q_set_refund --> q_set_fees: refundPeriodSeconds = config.refundPeriodSeconds
    q_set_fees --> q_set_fee_tokens: legionFeeOnCapitalRaisedBps = config.legionFeeOnCapitalRaisedBps, legionFeeOnTokensSoldBps = config.legionFeeOnTokensSoldBps
    q_set_fee_tokens --> q_set_referrer: referrerFeeOnCapitalRaisedBps = config.referrerFeeOnCapitalRaisedBps, referrerFeeOnTokensSoldBps = config.referrerFeeOnTokensSoldBps
    q_set_referrer --> q_set_addresses: set referrer fee params
    q_set_addresses --> q_set_flags: bidToken = config.bidToken, projectAdmin = config.projectAdmin, addressRegistry = config.addressRegistry
    q_set_flags --> [*]: hasEnded = false, isCanceled = false, tokensSupplied = false

    note right of q_validate
        INV-001: refundPeriodSeconds must be <= 14 days (1209600 seconds)
        INV-002: Fee basis points must be valid (0-10000 range)
        INV-003: bidToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry must be non-zero addresses
    end note
